# 0x demo GIF — render with:  vhs docs/demo.tape   (run from repo root)
Output website/assets/demo.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Padding 22

Hide
Type 'cd "/Users/hankim/아이오브연구소/0x-lang"' Enter
Type "shopt -s expand_aliases; alias 0x='node dist/cli.js'" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show

Sleep 600ms
Type "cat docs/demo.ai" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "0x build docs/demo.ai --target react,vue,svelte" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "# 18 lines of 0x -> React + Vue + Svelte, ~2.4x fewer tokens than React" Sleep 200ms Enter
Sleep 2500ms
